        "text_kGgQFb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ophelia began with a simple question: <em>Why is skincare so complicated?</em><br/></p><p>What started as a frustration with overhyped products and confusing routines turned into a mission to create formulas that are honest, effective, and universally usable.</p><p>Our team of chemists and dermatologists spent three years refining a range that cuts through noise—no exaggerated claims, no unnecessary fragrances, no cluttered routines. Just clean formulations that work for all skin types and all genders, backed by science and clarity.</p><p>Ophelia isn’t a trend. It’s a return to being straightforward.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "foreground"
          }
